{"ID":"20240513083031-nohi60z","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083031-nohi60z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083031-nohi60z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170541-5ymz3w9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170541-5ymz3w9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170541-5ymz3w9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:941,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:941\u0026#125;","title":"277","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115503"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513170541-5ymz3w9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 924px;","id":"20240513170541-5ymz3w9","updated":"20240515115503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄  初診日期：2008/05/14"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名212 L, HJ性別：女年齡及體型33歲，中等來診日期：2008/05/14"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：胃痛。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"寒熱：腳冷，睡時身體平溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身：右耳聽覺差，右側鼻子時塞，手足早起會有紅點，是塊狀的，會有點痛，不癢，左肋正下方偶爾會有一點刺痛，隱痛有半年了，左下腹偶爾有下墜痛感（小時有疝氣）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二便：大便一日一行量不多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"飲食：口渴喜溫飲，偶爾飯後胃痛，胃口好，偶爾嘔酸，但沒有以前那樣嚴重，吃了安中散比較沒那麼嚴重。飯後左心下方時悶痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"月經：月經準時，一星期結束。月經前失眠，第一天會頭痛，現正值經期第三四天，頭痛不像第一天那樣頭痛，生理期前時反胃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其它：喉中痰很多。常口臭，嘴唇乾，有時指甲會裂開。右肩中後方時酸痛，T5有壓痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：緩而無力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡白濕。\n2、眼診：腎陽沒什麼反應，心區顏色比較白。肺區有痰\n3、右耳心區有壓痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：腎陽不足，胃有寒濕，肺中有痰。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：吳茱萸二錢、乾薑二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治胃寒噁心。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳實三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→除胸悶。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"升麻三錢、黃耆五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→提氣補氣，用來治疝氣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"當歸二錢、川芎三錢、白芍五錢、熟地三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→四物湯組成，補血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子三錢、細辛二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎陽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"代赭石三錢、旋覆花二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治泛酸。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三錢、玉金五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→疏肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"辛夷三錢、菖蒲三錢、蒼朮三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治鼻塞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏三錢、南星三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"→除痰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心臟管月經，心臟力量夠的話，月經來前不會失眠。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"月經第一天來頭痛，一般是屬於比較血虛的，開個補血的藥，會慢慢減輕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生理期會反胃，胃比較寒，生理期前，要靠腸胃的陽吸收食物轉換成能量及奶水，所以腸胃工作就加倍，就會有反胃的情形。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"病在右側，女人右為氣，所以很多都是氣虛的現象。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"指甲裂因為不是常常裂，所以還好，肝其華在爪，我們開點清肝的藥，就會好，一般來說，肝有累積毒素在裡面指甲就會容易裂。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口臭，嘴唇乾，不一定是胃熱，腸胃太寒也會這樣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌淡白濕，脈緩無力，胃家寒濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"血不夠要懷孕很難。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"左肋的剌痛一定是胃酸造成。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雙耳耳鳴是腎虛，單耳有可能是擤鼻涕造成的。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"她瞳孔（腎陽）沒什麼反應所以用炮附子。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12. "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心區顏色比較白，血較不夠，所以月經來的第一天會頭痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}